              "text": "memorizzare — \"to memorise, to learn by heart\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Devo memorizzare venti parole al giorno. I have to memorise twenty words a day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "On a phone, also to save: memorizzare un numero. Imparare a memoria is more colloquial."
            }
          ]
