              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "gli appunti — \"the notes (taken in class)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mi presti i tuoi appunti? Ieri ero malato. Can you lend me your notes? I was ill yesterday."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Prendere appunti — to take notes. The singular appunto also means a reproach; the adverb appunto means exactly."
            }
          ]
        },
